    --- Returns the value of a graph parameter on this machine for the current tick: the value a script
    --- set, or else the value read from the world, or else its default. For a trigger, it returns
    --- whether the trigger is fired. Returns nil if no graph is loaded or the graph does not declare
    --- the name.
