    --- Adds an obstacle that agents walk around, such as a tree or a rock, as a circle on the ground.
    function AddObstacle(self, position: vector, radius: number): ()
    --- Removes every obstacle.
    function ClearObstacles(self): ()
    --- Sets an agent's tag: an integer from 0 to 65535 whose meaning the game defines, for example a
    --- kind in some bits and flags in others. Only the authority can call it. The tag replicates to
    --- every machine that has the agent. Those machines read it with `GetAgentTag` and receive
    --- `AgentTagChanged`; a client typically chooses a mesh and a pose from it. The tag an agent has
